.env*
*token*
*secret*
*credential*
*client_secret*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
Code.gs
*.gs
gas/
config*.yml
config*.yaml
*.sqlite
*.db

# ── 原始檔／工作檔，不是要對外的成品 ──
*.psd
*.ai
*.dwg
*.skp
*.xlsx
*.docx
*.pdf
*.md
!README.md

